1
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:38,530
Name your price.

2
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:41,480
At least this much.

3
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:43,170
That's robbery!

4
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:45,320
Then I'll just leave.

5
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:46,410
Sit down.

6
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:51,180
Let me see if it's worth the price.

7
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:11,280
Come here.

8
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:12,080
Hand it over.

9
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:16,700
We'll go with your number.

10
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:18,050
Give me everything.

11
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:20,320
Money first, then the goods.

12
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:23,000
If the money isn't in my account within three days,

13
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,440
the whole internet will know

14
00:01:24,440 --> 00:01:26,440
that Jin Xi's first love

15
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:30,120
is the actor who played Nie Xiaoqian,

16
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:32,360
Bai Feixin.

17
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:33,240
What?

18
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:34,460
Bai Feixin?

19
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:37,120
Come on.

20
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:38,000
Give it to me.

21
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,400
Let me take another look.

22
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:42,160
Just be quick, sis.

23
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:44,100
This...

24
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,560
Be more professional next time.

25
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:48,020
Get your facts straight before coming to me.

26
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:48,940
It's not you...

27
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:51,400
What is this?

28
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,400
What?

29
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,560
People on the internet

30
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:59,560
see a blurry photo and start talking nonsense.

31
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,120
Exactly.

32
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:01,360
They are all fake fans.

33
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:01,960
True fans like us

34
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:03,400
never believe or spread rumors.

35
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:03,760
Exactly.

36
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:06,360
We finally got an official announcement after ages.

37
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:08,759
We don't need these candid paparazzi shots.

38
00:02:08,759 --> 00:02:10,620
Sisters, let's chant the slogan!

39
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,720
No substitutes.

40
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:14,040
No fake romance.

41
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:16,560
We only ship the real deal!

42
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:19,600
Bai Feixin's real-life Nie Xiaoqian quest:

43
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,530
Fall in love with a scholar.

44
00:02:21,760 --> 00:02:22,840
Get caught by paparazzi.

45
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,360
Three,

46
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:25,560
wait for a Yan Chixia to catch the demon.

47
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,640
Heying, they're talking about you.

48
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:30,920
In the novel, Xiaoqian is 300 years older than Caichen.

49
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:32,720
In reality, the woman is five years older.

50
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:36,120
Did they grab the wrong Book of Life and Death during casting?

51
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:38,960
Bai Feixin's age

52
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:40,320
is now known to everyone.

53
00:02:40,320 --> 00:02:42,200
When other top stars go public,

54
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:44,440
they post handwritten letters and comics of their first meeting.

55
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:45,920
But when you two do it,

56
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:47,560
it's nine blurry paparazzi photos,

57
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:49,200
featuring a trash can.

58
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:53,360
Underworld couples really bring hellish aesthetics to their announcements.

59
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:55,320
These people are too mean.

60
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:56,400
But I really didn't expect

61
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:59,060
the paparazzi to think Feixin was in the photos.

62
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:00,440
But this also proves that

63
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:01,320
our whole troupe

64
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:03,200
kept the secret for Jinxi and the director.

65
00:03:03,200 --> 00:03:04,800
No one sold them out.

66
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,060
Everyone's character

67
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:07,040
is rock solid.

68
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:10,600
Um,

69
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,760
have you guys seen Feixin?

70
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:14,520
Why haven't I seen her today?

71
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:31,200
I'm ready to clear things up.

72
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:35,320
You look like you're going to make an official announcement.

73
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,160
It's hard to be a woman.

74
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:39,320
It's harder to be a beautiful woman.

75
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:42,040
And it's even harder to be a famous, beautiful woman.

76
00:03:42,040 --> 00:03:43,240
But it's fine.

77
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:45,000
It's something I have to face sooner or later.

78
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,840
I'm mentally prepared.

79
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:48,740
Xiaoqi,

80
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,530
book me a Thermage session.

81
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:51,720
Why?

82
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:52,640
Why don't you book it yourself?

83
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:53,760
Finding an assistant right now

84
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:54,560
is too last-minute.

85
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:55,840
Plus, they wouldn't know me well enough.

86
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:59,600
Also go custom-tailor a nicer outfit.

87
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:01,160
It doesn't matter if it's a bit expensive.

88
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:03,840
I want to face the media looking my best.

89
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:06,440
Why do you need to see the media?

90
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:09,170
For unverified and fabricated things like this,

91
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:11,240
it'll blow over after a couple of days on the internet.

92
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,080
Look.

93
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,960
No serious media is reporting it.

94
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,120
Just ignore it.

95
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:15,720
No.

96
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:18,200
Whether people believe it or not,

97
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:19,930
this matter must be clarified.

98
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,160
Ning Jin.

99
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:27,040
Are you jealous?

100
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:30,560
I simply hate this kind of thing.

101
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:33,650
After all, our troupe focuses on the work itself.

102
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,290
Don't worry.

103
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,960
I know what you're thinking.

104
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,600
I'll go and make it clear to them.

105
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:48,440
Alright.

106
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:50,000
Real couples make the call.

107
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:51,280
Okay.

108
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:54,320
Let me think about how to clarify this.

109
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:02,640
Look carefully.

110
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,570
Say everything according to this.

111
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:05,530
Don't mess it up.

112
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:08,000
You must follow what's written here, got it?

113
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,400
Don't worry, no problem.

114
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:12,860
You're so obedient today.

115
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:58,640
Thank you, The Landlord's Cats.

116
00:06:58,640 --> 00:07:00,400
It was so healing and warm.

117
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:02,000
And the other guest

118
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:04,240
is Jin Xi sitting next to me.

119
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:04,840
Recently,

120
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:06,640
news about Jin Xi's romance

121
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:08,840
has dominated the headlines of major websites.

122
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:11,440
Today, our show is very honored

123
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:13,960
to be the first media to invite Jin Xi.

124
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:15,120
Regarding such news,

125
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:17,320
what will Jin Xi herself respond?

126
00:07:17,320 --> 00:07:18,800
The answer will be revealed soon.

127
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:21,400
Let's hand over the time to Jin Xi.

128
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,040
I, Jin Xi,

129
00:07:32,159 --> 00:07:35,040
issue the following statement to all netizens.

130
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,600
Ms. Bai Feixin

131
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,760
is merely my co-actor in the musical

132
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:40,600
'A Chinese Ghost Story'.

133
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,320
During the rehearsal period,

134
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:45,960
we have always maintained a normal colleague and friend relationship.

135
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:49,640
I strongly condemn the behavior of some media through speculation,

136
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:51,240
making things out of nothing,

137
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:53,240
and fabricating false plots.

138
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:56,850
We have initiated legal procedures to trace the source.

139
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:59,120
It's rare to see him make such a serious public statement.

140
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:01,560
Obviously, Sister Hu forced him to say this.

141
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,320
We reiterate once again,

142
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:06,160
please refer only to official channels for information.

143
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:10,240
Any unverified speculative remarks constitute infringement.

144
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:14,240
For subjects who continuously damage the artist's reputation with false information,

145
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:17,240
We will pursue legal responsibilities in accordance with the law.

146
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,640
Hereby announced.

147
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:20,160
Our brother spoke so well.

148
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:22,040
We will always stand with our brother.

149
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,040
Shout the slogan!

150
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:24,800
No shipping substitutes.

151
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:26,240
No fake sweetness.

152
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:28,760
Only ship what's real.

153
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:30,200
All right.

154
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:32,840
That is indeed a very serious statement.

155
00:08:32,919 --> 00:08:34,559
Regarding such false rumors,

156
00:08:34,559 --> 00:08:36,440
our show always adheres to

157
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:38,360
the principle of not believing or spreading rumors.

158
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,159
As for this matter,

159
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:41,400
we won't discuss it any further.

160
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:42,080
Next up,

161
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:44,039
let's go to today's celebrity scene.

162
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:44,800
Please welcome Jin Xi.

163
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:45,600
Wait a minute.

164
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,260
I still have a few words

165
00:08:49,760 --> 00:08:51,090
I want to say to someone.

166
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:56,600
That person

167
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:59,160
is the director of the musical I'm rehearsing now,

168
00:08:59,160 --> 00:09:00,640
'A Chinese Ghost Story',

169
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,640
Ning Jin.

170
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:05,160
She is my real girlfriend.

171
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,720
Jin Xi!

172
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:15,400
She is the one kissing me in the photo.

173
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,400
My current mood

174
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,920
is just like the lyrics in a song.

175
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,120
If you love me,

176
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:25,920
broadcast it to the whole world.

177
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:28,000
I want everyone to know

178
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:32,100
I've received the best love in the world.

179
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:34,000
I want everyone to know

180
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:37,050
I'm willing to give you the best love in the world.

181
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,040
Ning Jin,

182
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:39,920
I love you.

183
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:57,440
This is too cheesy.

184
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:58,200
So cheesy.

185
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,120
Take notes.

186
00:10:00,800 --> 00:10:01,200
This...

187
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,120
Is this true?

188
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,400
Please don't panic.

189
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:05,360
Even though Jinxi has a girlfriend,

190
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:05,840
but

191
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,920
he is still the Jinxi you love.

192
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:08,840
And I promise,

193
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:11,440
Director Ning Jin is a very good person.

194
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:13,400
Please don't be hostile towards her, okay?

195
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:14,800
It's not hostility.

196
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:17,400
We are very touched.

197
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:20,400
I think what he said was really touching.

198
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:22,560
It's the first time I've heard him sound so affectionate.

199
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:24,360
I love it.

200
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:26,680
And I think they're a great match.

201
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:28,720
Ning Jin,

202
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:30,560
aren't you excited at all?

203
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:31,720
It's official.

204
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,200
So many people are listening.

205
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,840
How romantic!

206
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:39,160
The director must be so happy they could faint.

207
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:40,960
Too excited to even speak.

208
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:45,400
Director,

209
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:46,400
where are you going?

210
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:47,840
Then write a press release for me immediately.

211
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:48,800
It must be sincere,

212
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:49,760
and the wording must be precise.

213
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:50,240
Very precise.

214
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,040
Got it?

215
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:51,840
What do you think, Sister Hu?

216
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:52,440
Sister Hu,

217
00:10:52,560 --> 00:10:53,040
are you surprised?

218
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:53,720
Unexpected?

219
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:54,560
Romantic, right?

220
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:54,960
You...

221
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:56,560
Okay.

222
00:10:56,560 --> 00:10:57,600
Alright.

223
00:10:57,680 --> 00:10:59,400
I wonder what Ning Jin is thinking right now.

224
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:02,000
She must be both surprised and excited.

225
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,560
Maybe even a little shy.

226
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:04,560
I need to go see.

227
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:05,890
I'm leaving, Sister Hu.

228
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:07,680
Alright.

229
00:11:07,680 --> 00:11:08,320
Okay.

230
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:09,440
Dear friends.

231
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:10,240
Yes,

232
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:13,120
I saw Jinxi's official announcement.

233
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:15,380
Please don't misunderstand us anymore.

234
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:17,240
As Ning Jin's best friend,

235
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:19,120
Jinxi can be so honest

236
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:19,920
about her relationship.

237
00:11:19,920 --> 00:11:23,000
I am really happy for them.

238
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:24,720
I believe

239
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:28,640
Ning Jin must be even more thrilled than I am right now.

240
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:43,090
So you were waiting for me here.

241
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:48,040
How is it?

242
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:49,840
Did you listen to my podcast?

243
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:53,120
Not only did I clarify the situation with Bai Feixin,

244
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:55,320
but I also officially announced our relationship.

245
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:58,050
Now the internet is full of comments praising us.

246
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:00,320
Look.

247
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:03,560
'I suggest the Civil Affairs Bureau move directly into Lanruo Temple.'

248
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:05,240
'Forbidden romance between a scholar and a director

249
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:07,560
is ten thousand times more exciting than a human-ghost love story.'

250
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:09,560
'Others announce relationships with a nine-photo grid,

251
00:12:09,560 --> 00:12:10,360
which is blunt and cliché.'

252
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:11,120
'Only Jin Xi

253
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:12,400
includes a plot twist in her official announcement.'

254
00:12:12,400 --> 00:12:14,320
'As expected of the top-tier star who is a workaholic and a hopeless romantic.'

255
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,560
'This combination is just too good.'

256
00:12:15,560 --> 00:12:16,200
'Director Ning Jin,

257
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,320
for your next project you should just film

258
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:20,920
Ning Caichen's Rebirth: I Am the Director's Pampered Husband.'

259
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:29,200
Why aren't you saying anything?

260
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:32,160
Are you

261
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:34,240
shy,

262
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:36,640
or

263
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:37,760
touched?

264
00:12:38,640 --> 00:12:40,640
Look at all these comments wishing us well.

265
00:12:40,640 --> 00:12:41,080
Jin Xi.

266
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:47,170
There are some things I don't understand.

267
00:12:47,400 --> 00:12:50,530
Are you just acting like you like me in front of everyone,

268
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:53,440
or are you just satisfying your own ego?

269
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:56,360
Ning Jin.

270
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:57,890
I don't care which one it is.

271
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:02,770
It doesn't seem to have anything to do with me.

272
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:04,600
Are you...

273
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:05,480
not...

274
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:06,880
happy?

275
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:09,560
I feel like

276
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:12,440
having so many people bless us is

277
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:14,360
a very happy thing.

278
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:17,290
Dating is between the two of us.

279
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,000
Telling everyone like this,

280
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:20,460
did you ask for my opinion?

281
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:24,320
What do you mean?

282
00:13:26,400 --> 00:13:27,640
You really are someone

283
00:13:27,640 --> 00:13:29,440
who only thinks about yourself,

284
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:31,690
who doesn't respect me,

285
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:34,440
and doesn't consider me.

286
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:47,090
I think we're not right for each other.

287
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:48,700
Let's break up.

288
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:52,800
Wait.

289
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,000
So what do you want me to do?

290
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:57,640
You were the one who kissed me first,

291
00:13:57,640 --> 00:14:00,000
and you were the one who said you had feelings for me.

292
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:01,240
You wanted us to keep our distance,

293
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:02,320
so we did.

294
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:04,450
You wanted us to be together, so we are.

295
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:06,400
Between the two of us, who is

296
00:14:06,400 --> 00:14:07,920
the self-centered one?

297
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:09,760
That's right.

298
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:14,160
I am just

299
00:14:14,160 --> 00:14:15,800
a self-centered person.

300
00:14:17,760 --> 00:14:19,000
So now you understand

301
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:20,720
how annoying it is

302
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:23,050
to not consider other people's feelings.

303
00:15:55,320 --> 00:15:56,120
Brother.

304
00:15:57,840 --> 00:16:00,640
If you don't want to eat, at least drink some water.

305
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:03,980
Let me tell you.

306
00:16:04,400 --> 00:16:07,040
The director was just speaking out of anger.

307
00:16:07,920 --> 00:16:08,800
For instance,

308
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:11,010
Cousin and Master Jiao.

309
00:16:11,400 --> 00:16:13,040
Don't they argue every day too?

310
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:14,000
Did they break up?

311
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,200
They are doing great.

312
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:18,000
What happened between you and the director

313
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,080
is just

314
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:21,960
a normal argument between a normal couple.

315
00:16:22,400 --> 00:16:25,400
Everyone is like this when they are in a relationship.

316
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:27,960
Really?

317
00:16:28,160 --> 00:16:28,720
Really.

318
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:31,050
Just coax him a bit more and he will be fine.

319
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:32,840
A normal argument?

320
00:16:33,040 --> 00:16:34,100
A normal argument.

321
00:16:34,160 --> 00:16:35,220
Coax him a bit more.

322
00:16:40,040 --> 00:16:40,970
Feeling better?

323
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:44,060
Eat something.

324
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:46,140
I'll get it for you.

325
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:52,200
Hello.

326
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:53,920
Yes.

327
00:16:53,920 --> 00:16:54,440
It's me.

328
00:16:56,240 --> 00:16:56,880
Really?

329
00:16:58,000 --> 00:16:59,320
I have time.

330
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:01,000
Tomorrow.

331
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,840
I will be there on time at 9 AM tomorrow.

332
00:17:02,840 --> 00:17:04,000
Thank you.

333
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:09,400
I got selected!

334
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:11,560
Selected for what?

335
00:17:11,560 --> 00:17:13,240
That variety show, 'Top Music'.

336
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:14,960
I sent them the songs I wrote,

337
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:16,040
and they liked them.

338
00:17:16,040 --> 00:17:17,500
They asked me to go record.

339
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:20,319
When did you sign up?

340
00:17:20,319 --> 00:17:21,359
I told you about it.

341
00:17:21,359 --> 00:17:22,400
I told you twice.

342
00:17:22,839 --> 00:17:24,160
Once at Sister Hu's company,

343
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:26,040
and the other time was when we watched a movie.

344
00:17:26,040 --> 00:17:26,640
Remember?

345
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:29,760
How long will you be gone?

346
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:31,480
Probably a month.

347
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:32,560
But don't worry,

348
00:17:32,560 --> 00:17:33,640
I've already talked to Sister Hu.

349
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:36,300
A new assistant will take care of you this month.

350
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:47,040
Aren't you happy for me?

351
00:17:50,800 --> 00:17:52,400
Are you really going

352
00:17:53,120 --> 00:17:54,650
to leave at a time like this?

353
00:17:55,560 --> 00:17:57,920
But this is my dream.

354
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:58,720
My dream

355
00:17:59,320 --> 00:18:02,050
isn't to be your assistant for the rest of my life.

356
00:18:02,360 --> 00:18:02,800
No.

357
00:18:03,320 --> 00:18:05,400
What do you mean 'be an assistant for the rest of your life'?

358
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:06,800
I've never treated you like an assistant.

359
00:18:06,800 --> 00:18:07,840
I treat you as a friend.

360
00:18:07,840 --> 00:18:09,500
I treat you as my best brother.

361
00:18:09,640 --> 00:18:11,400
I'm at the lowest point in my life right now.

362
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:12,840
Do you really have to leave now?

363
00:18:12,840 --> 00:18:14,240
How can you be so selfish?

364
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:16,960
I'm selfish?

365
00:18:20,360 --> 00:18:21,760
I knew this would happen.

366
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:24,120
I knew after I told you,

367
00:18:24,120 --> 00:18:25,380
you'd react like this.

368
00:18:26,640 --> 00:18:27,840
You just want me to be

369
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:30,440
a sidekick who follows you around all the time.

370
00:18:30,840 --> 00:18:31,600
Right?

371
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:34,320
No.

372
00:18:36,800 --> 00:18:38,200
I can't explain it to you.

373
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:42,120
Just leave if you want to.

374
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:21,560
After Jin Xi's relationship was exposed,

375
00:19:21,560 --> 00:19:22,560
public opinion has been positive,

376
00:19:22,560 --> 00:19:25,000
and audience expectations for A Chinese Ghost Story are very high.

377
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:26,840
I think we can take advantage of this opportunity

378
00:19:26,840 --> 00:19:29,770
to develop spin-off businesses related to the play.

379
00:19:29,840 --> 00:19:31,900
This is my brother's private matter.

380
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:33,040
Do not interfere.

381
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:33,440
Yes.

382
00:19:46,720 --> 00:19:47,160
Jinxi.

383
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:48,680
What's wrong?

384
00:19:49,320 --> 00:19:50,180
Where is Eason?

385
00:19:50,560 --> 00:19:51,200
Jinxi.

386
00:19:52,040 --> 00:19:52,900
What happened?

387
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:53,840
What happened to him?

388
00:19:53,840 --> 00:19:54,570
Pretty good.

389
00:19:55,320 --> 00:19:57,050
Then I'll arrange it like this.

390
00:20:00,840 --> 00:20:01,640
What's wrong?

391
00:20:03,360 --> 00:20:04,220
Gather around.

392
00:20:12,560 --> 00:20:13,080
Jinxi.

393
00:20:14,040 --> 00:20:16,040
Before rehearsal, let me just say,

394
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:19,240
today we're rehearsing Ning Caichen's entrance song.

395
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:19,800
Jinxi,

396
00:20:20,040 --> 00:20:20,640
Jiaoye,

397
00:20:20,800 --> 00:20:21,460
and Heying,

398
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:23,000
go practice with the group dance instructor.

399
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:23,560
Okay.

400
00:20:23,840 --> 00:20:26,300
The rest of you, practice with Mr. Qingsong.

401
00:20:29,120 --> 00:20:30,380
There's one more thing

402
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:31,810
I want to tell everyone.

403
00:20:32,560 --> 00:20:34,000
Jinxi and I have resumed

404
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:36,260
a normal director-actor relationship.

405
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:41,840
Okay.

406
00:20:41,840 --> 00:20:43,240
Let's start rehearsing.

407
00:20:52,240 --> 00:20:53,570
Did you know about this?

408
00:21:09,800 --> 00:21:10,330
Let's go.

409
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:11,450
Let's go.

410
00:21:18,440 --> 00:21:19,440
Come on, let's go.

411
00:21:45,360 --> 00:21:46,620
I really didn't expect

412
00:21:46,840 --> 00:21:48,370
you to ask me out for a drink.

413
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:52,240
If I went to Sister Hu

414
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:53,640
or anyone else right now,

415
00:21:54,120 --> 00:21:55,650
they would only comfort me.

416
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:57,000
But this time,

417
00:21:58,360 --> 00:22:00,290
I really feel like I made a mistake.

418
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:02,120
So you're

419
00:22:03,240 --> 00:22:04,570
drowning your sorrows?

420
00:22:07,240 --> 00:22:08,760
This time, I feel like

421
00:22:09,880 --> 00:22:11,280
everything I do is wrong.

422
00:22:12,640 --> 00:22:14,500
Ning Jin wants to break up with me.

423
00:22:15,160 --> 00:22:17,080
My best friend Eason left too.

424
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:19,800
Bro.

425
00:22:21,840 --> 00:22:24,040
Am I a very selfish person?

426
00:22:27,440 --> 00:22:28,570
You're not selfish.

427
00:22:30,560 --> 00:22:31,560
But,

428
00:22:32,240 --> 00:22:33,840
sometimes you're too used to

429
00:22:34,240 --> 00:22:36,840
looking at things from the wrong perspective.

430
00:22:43,480 --> 00:22:44,740
You really are someone

431
00:22:44,800 --> 00:22:46,400
who only thinks of yourself,

432
00:22:47,440 --> 00:22:48,400
disrespects me,

433
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:51,860
and never considers my feelings.

434
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:53,840
You sound just like Ning Jin.

435
00:22:56,040 --> 00:22:57,000
She also said

436
00:22:58,160 --> 00:23:00,220
Dad didn't let me play guitar at home,

437
00:23:00,840 --> 00:23:02,170
not because he hates me,

438
00:23:03,920 --> 00:23:05,920
but because he's afraid of the memories.

439
00:23:05,920 --> 00:23:08,000
Seeing the guitar reminds him of Mom.

440
00:23:08,840 --> 00:23:09,720
Do you remember

441
00:23:10,640 --> 00:23:11,770
when we were little,

442
00:23:12,120 --> 00:23:13,360
we bought a dog,

443
00:23:14,400 --> 00:23:16,400
and Dad gave it away after a few days?

444
00:23:17,560 --> 00:23:18,220
I remember.

445
00:23:19,600 --> 00:23:21,460
But what you might not remember is

446
00:23:22,160 --> 00:23:23,890
that you were allergic to dogs.

447
00:23:24,560 --> 00:23:27,360
You kept sneezing and had a rash for those few days.

448
00:23:29,880 --> 00:23:32,610
Actually, I've always envied your sense of self.

449
00:23:33,440 --> 00:23:34,560
But sometimes,

450
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:37,060
if you're too self-centered,

451
00:23:37,120 --> 00:23:38,380
you might hurt others.

452
00:23:40,240 --> 00:23:41,640
So we need to

453
00:23:41,640 --> 00:23:42,920
find a balance between

454
00:23:43,800 --> 00:23:45,060
ourselves and others.

455
00:23:51,320 --> 00:23:51,680
Bro,

456
00:23:52,840 --> 00:23:54,570
why are you always so sensible?

457
00:24:02,120 --> 00:24:04,250
Actually, being sensible all the time

458
00:24:04,600 --> 00:24:05,730
is quite tiring too.

459
00:24:07,360 --> 00:24:08,640
I wish one day

460
00:24:08,960 --> 00:24:09,960
I could be like you

461
00:24:10,840 --> 00:24:12,170
and be willful for once.

462
00:24:13,840 --> 00:24:15,240
Cheers to being willful.

463
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:18,460
Cheers to being sensible.

464
00:24:40,240 --> 00:24:41,400
You're up next.

465
00:24:41,640 --> 00:24:42,560
Are you ready?

466
00:24:42,560 --> 00:24:44,690
Sister, I can't see the back of my head.

467
00:24:44,960 --> 00:24:46,120
I'll look at the back of your head.

468
00:24:46,120 --> 00:24:46,920
Tell me if it's round.

469
00:24:46,920 --> 00:24:48,240
It's fine. Very good.

470
00:24:48,240 --> 00:24:48,680
No problem.

471
00:24:48,680 --> 00:24:50,240
Can you take a picture for me?

472
00:24:50,240 --> 00:24:51,920
I told you it looks great.

473
00:24:54,840 --> 00:24:55,200
Look.

474
00:24:55,560 --> 00:24:56,200
Take it from above.

475
00:24:56,200 --> 00:24:57,240
I can't see the whole thing right now.

476
00:24:57,240 --> 00:24:57,600
I...

477
00:24:57,600 --> 00:24:58,240
It's very good.

478
00:24:58,240 --> 00:24:59,400
The back of your head, the back of your neck,

479
00:24:59,400 --> 00:25:00,560
your whole back, it's all very good.

480
00:25:00,560 --> 00:25:01,600
Is my guitar in tune?

481
00:25:01,600 --> 00:25:02,560
From my angle,

482
00:25:02,560 --> 00:25:03,960
your back looks absolutely handsome.

483
00:25:03,960 --> 00:25:05,640
This must bring a lot of pressure, right?

484
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:06,170
Brother.

485
00:25:07,080 --> 00:25:08,010
Why are you here?

486
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:13,040
Give me the guitar.

487
00:25:13,040 --> 00:25:14,640
Audience members,

488
00:25:14,640 --> 00:25:17,160
please pick up your voting devices.

489
00:25:17,400 --> 00:25:18,840
Red means you like it.

490
00:25:18,840 --> 00:25:20,400
Green means you don't.

491
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:23,400
Alright, let's all vote now.

492
00:25:29,040 --> 00:25:29,760
Nervous?

493
00:25:31,320 --> 00:25:31,880
A little.

494
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:33,660
I'll teach you a trick.

495
00:25:34,640 --> 00:25:35,640
When you sing later,

496
00:25:35,640 --> 00:25:37,800
just imagine the audience as big radishes,

497
00:25:37,800 --> 00:25:38,920
cabbages, or watermelons,

498
00:25:38,920 --> 00:25:40,160
or whatever you want.

499
00:25:40,160 --> 00:25:42,040
W-why radishes?

500
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:43,120
Just...

501
00:25:43,120 --> 00:25:44,240
anything you want.

502
00:25:44,240 --> 00:25:44,880
As long as

503
00:25:45,160 --> 00:25:46,600
it makes you not nervous.

504
00:25:47,240 --> 00:25:48,760
I-I choose a water vat.

505
00:25:48,760 --> 00:25:49,400
A water vat?

506
00:25:49,400 --> 00:25:49,920
A water vat.

507
00:25:49,920 --> 00:25:50,960
Why a water vat?

508
00:25:50,960 --> 00:25:52,960
Have you forgotten when we first met?

509
00:25:52,960 --> 00:25:53,800
I went for an interview,

510
00:25:53,800 --> 00:25:55,000
and you said you were really dehydrated

511
00:25:55,000 --> 00:25:56,320
and needed to drink lots of water every day.

512
00:25:56,320 --> 00:25:58,580
You told me your nickname is 'Water Vat'.

513
00:25:58,760 --> 00:25:59,400
Okay.

514
00:25:59,720 --> 00:26:00,880
Then a big water vat it is.

515
00:26:00,880 --> 00:26:01,740
A big water vat.

516
00:26:03,720 --> 00:26:05,120
Now let's...

517
00:26:05,280 --> 00:26:05,880
I'm sorry.

518
00:26:06,640 --> 00:26:08,040
I should be happy for you.

519
00:26:08,600 --> 00:26:09,460
I came this time

520
00:26:10,560 --> 00:26:11,690
just to cheer you on.

521
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:15,360
'The Song You Made Me Write'.

522
00:26:15,840 --> 00:26:17,320
Please welcome with applause,

523
00:26:17,320 --> 00:26:18,960
Eason.

524
00:26:21,760 --> 00:26:22,960
They're calling you.

525
00:26:23,360 --> 00:26:23,920
Wait.

526
00:26:26,320 --> 00:26:26,920
Good luck.

527
00:26:27,720 --> 00:26:28,040
Good luck.

528
00:26:28,040 --> 00:26:28,960
Big water vat.

529
00:26:29,800 --> 00:26:30,600
Big water vat.

530
00:26:43,720 --> 00:26:44,720
Come on.

531
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:55,640
Sister Hu,

532
00:27:56,200 --> 00:27:59,120
does it remind you of my first time on stage?

533
00:28:03,240 --> 00:28:04,000
Sister Hu.

534
00:28:04,040 --> 00:28:04,840
From now on,

535
00:28:05,280 --> 00:28:07,340
I won't be so self-centered anymore.

536
00:28:08,400 --> 00:28:10,840
I will consider things from your perspective.

537
00:28:10,840 --> 00:28:12,560
I won't make you babysit me at work

538
00:28:12,560 --> 00:28:13,640
and after work.

539
00:28:15,560 --> 00:28:16,560
You said it.

540
00:28:17,640 --> 00:28:18,400
Don't cry.
